.TH KUMDE 1 "2026" "kumde 0.8.0" "KumDE Manual"
.SH NAME
kumde \- Wayland compositor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kumde
[\fB\-h\fR] [\fB\-v\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
kumde is a minimal Wayland compositor built on wlroots. It provides floating
and tiling window management, nine independent per-output workspaces, window
animations, drop shadows, rounded corners, and an IPC socket for scripting.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h
Print usage and exit.
.TP
.B \-v
Print version and exit.
.SH CONFIGURATION
.B $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/kumde/kumde.conf
or
.B ~/.config/kumde/kumde.conf
.PP
An example configuration is installed at
.IR /usr/share/kumde/kumde.conf .
.SH KEY BINDINGS
.TP
.B Super+q
Quit.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+q
Shutdown system.
.TP
.B Super+Tab
Cycle window focus.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+c
Close focused window.
.TP
.B Super+t
Toggle tile/floating layout.
.TP
.B Super+m
Monocle layout.
.TP
.B Super+Space
Toggle floating for focused window.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+f
Toggle fullscreen for focused window.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+l
Lock screen (spawns kumlock).
.TP
.B Super+Return
Swap focused window with master.
.TP
.B Super+1\-9
Switch workspace.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+1\-9
Move focused window to workspace.
.TP
.B Super+grave
Toggle scratchpad (workspace 9).
.TP
.B Super+Arrow
Focus adjacent output.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+Arrow
Resize focused window or adjust master ratio in tile mode.
.TP
.B Super+k
Next keyboard layout.
.TP
.B Super+Print
Screenshot (saves to ~/Pictures/).
.TP
.B XF86AudioRaiseVolume / XF86AudioLowerVolume / XF86AudioMute
Volume control via wpctl (no modifier).
.TP
.B XF86MonBrightnessUp / XF86MonBrightnessDown
Brightness control via brightnessctl (no modifier).
.SH IPC
kumde exposes a Unix socket at
.IR $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/kumde-ipc .
The path is exported as
.BR KUMDE_IPC .
See
.BR kumde-msg (1)
for usage.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kumde-msg (1),
.BR kumbar (1),
.BR kumlock (1),
.BR kumlauncher (1),
.BR kumshot (1),
.BR kumidle (1),
.BR kumnotify (1),
.BR kumclip (1),
.BR kumwall (1)
